<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - 360 Comm cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - 360 Comm cut to hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities said it downgraded 360 Communications Co to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 1/2 to 17-1/8.</p>
